[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 67.67, "timestamp": "00:01:07", "text": "不呢？不過，還是要謝謝你的光臨。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 70.39, "timestamp": "00:01:10", "text": "呃，我不知道有沒有人透過"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 71.138, "timestamp": "00:01:11", "author": "@AkiAki-l8u", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nLOZiVoOnOY9sRG6PEfbeJQZgNEc94Ld_-R0YhapW-QHpFlNNHtQIwpPu8VJKX5wVYKg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hiiii"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 72.91, "timestamp": "00:01:12", "text": "Twitch 觀看，但還是要感謝所有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 75.31, "timestamp": "00:01:15", "text": "Lersing 的朋友。意義重大。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 78.91, "timestamp": "00:01:18", "text": "我累死了，真的好累。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 81.10900000000001, "timestamp": "00:01:21", "text": "你好。所以，有些事情我想跟大家"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 83.51, "timestamp": "00:01:23", "text": "討論。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 85.99, "timestamp": "00:01:25", "text": "現在想和大家討論一些事情，我注意到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 87.99, "timestamp": "00:01:27", "text": "大多數第一次來看我直播的新觀眾，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 91.51, "timestamp": "00:01:31", "text": "以及大多數不了解情況的觀眾，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 95.19, "timestamp": "00:01:35", "text": "如果我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 98.149, "timestamp": "00:01:38", "text": "在直播中輸入 V，他們會感到困惑。即使在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 101.429, "timestamp": "00:01:41", "text": "某些平台上有置頂評論，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 103.27000000000001, "timestamp": "00:01:43", "text": "他們也沒有置頂功能。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 107.67, "timestamp": "00:01:47", "text": "所以有些平台我忘了加個提示，說明"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 110.789, "timestamp": "00:01:50", "text": "這是點播內容，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 112.71000000000001, "timestamp": "00:01:52", "text": "我正在休息等等。所以我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 115.22999999999999, "timestamp": "00:01:55", "text": "打算做一個類似小型"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 116.749, "timestamp": "00:01:56", "text": "彈出窗口的東西，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 119.749, "timestamp": "00:0